{
  "statement": "I appreciate the emphasis on safety and trustworthiness in the RollCall system. However, I believe that performance efficiency is equally crucial. I maintain support for EFF-01, EFF-02, EFF-03, EFF-04, EFF-05, EFF-06, and EFF-07 as they ensure optimal system performance. I propose a synthesis where SAF-02's real-time data synchronization is re-evaluated to allow for a slight delay during peak loads without compromising accuracy. This could balance safety and efficiency while still meeting the operational needs of the system.",
